/* The plain-HTTP half of the same front door, split out of https_server.c,
 * plus the two-file seam header. Narrower than the rule above on purpose:
 * this file has no site-route dispatch, so it cannot reach the blog/models
 * app groups. What DOES reach it is path_check --- test_path_check.c drives
 * https_server_handle_http_for_testing() and
 * https_server_acme_challenge_filepath_for_testing(), both defined here. */
