/* BLAKE3 is TRANSFER-layer only (docs/work/WIRE_COMPILE_CACHE.md): never
 * consensus (SHA-256d, Equihash BLAKE2b) and never stored identity
 * (content.v2 SHA3-256). The official-vector KAT is the whole proof
 * surface — there is no second implementation to differential against. */
