AGENT_IMPACT_RULE("docs/ARCHITECTURE_DIAGRAMS.md|docs/ARCH_QUEST_BOARD.md|docs/DEVELOPING.md", "make_lint_gates")
/* LANE seed-bootstrap-doors: the ways a cold node can reach the network at
