/* Fuzz-artifact triage tooling: promote_fuzz_artifacts.sh now REPLAYS an
 * artifact (stock + pattern-init for crash-/leak- kinds) before it ever
 * files a verdict, instead of labeling from the filename; the shared
 * pattern-init/named-fix vocabulary that decision and check_fuzz_artifact_
 * replay.sh's ledger enforcement both read lives in fuzz_verdict_lib.sh;
 * background_quality_lane.sh's fuzz lane checks (and best-effort refreshes)
 * whether its own checkout is pinned behind main via
