 * tests/test_platform.c). Both are now REHOMED into lib/test/src as
 * registered catalog groups, assertions verbatim, so each one executes on
 * every suite run. Each file defines the int test_<name>(void) entry named by
 * its own ZCL_TEST_GROUP row, and a test source's own group is the only group
