 * length) and asserts a binding differing in any single member does not
 * match. */
AGENT_IMPACT_RULE("lib/test/src/test_directory_watcher.c", "directory_watcher make_lint_gates")
AGENT_IMPACT_RULE("lib/test/src/test_watcher_record.c", "watcher_record make_lint_gates")

/* Eight probe programs that the merge REHOMED out of the old tools/tests
 * directory into lib/test/src, where each became a registered catalog group.
 * Unlike the acceptance programs above these really do execute: each file
 * defines the int test_<name>(void) entry named by its own
 * ZCL_TEST_GROUP row, so t-fast-exact runs it. A test source's own group is
 * the only group that executes it, so each rule names exactly that group and
 * the lint tier -- naming the group of the code under test as well would be
 * coverage this file cannot claim.
 *
 * What each one drives, for the record: read_mapping_positioned opens a
 * fixture through platform_read_mapping_open_positioned and asserts the
