 * are unchanged across the read; socket_resolve asserts
 * platform_socket_resolve_ip yields v4-mapped bytes for a dotted quad and
 * refuses a malformed hostname; private_link_no_clobber asserts a private
 * link is made only under a VERIFIED file identity and never clobbers;
 * replay_receipt_root asserts the replay receipt binds its counts to the
 * bundle digest and refuses a single flipped bit; file_ops_copy asserts the
 * POSIX copy path and its directory-destination refusal; boot_refusal_identity
 * calls boot_report_datadir_create_failed with EACCES and asserts
 * boot_error_last_render carries the identity= token; and
 * boot_shutdown_marker_persistence writes, reads back clean, and removes the
